    "quote": "Let $\\pi\\in \\Pi$ be a uniformly good algorithm. For any $\\theta\\in \\Theta$, we have: \\lim\\inf_{T\\to\\infty} \\frac{R^\\pi(T,\\theta)}{\\ln~T} \\ge C(\\theta), where $C(\\theta)$ is the value of the optimization problem: minimize \\sum_{x} \\eta(x) (\\mu^\\star(\\theta) - \\mu(x,\\theta)) subject to \\sum_{x} \\eta(x) D( \\theta, \\lambda, x) \\ge 1, \\forall \\lambda \\in \\Lambda(\\theta)..."
